@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home Page";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome</h1>
    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-3">
        <li><a asp-controller="GameSystems" asp-action="Index">Game Systems</a></li>
        <li><a asp-controller="Oracles" asp-action="Index">Oracles</a></li>
        <li><a asp-controller="Flows" asp-action="Index">Flows</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>This tool is designed to be a Gamemaster's Toolkit.</p>
</div>
<h2 class="display-6">Current Features:</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Game systems to group oracles and flows</li>
    <li>Oracle builder — dice tables and playing-card / tarot decks</li>
    <ul>
        <li>Dice oracles use a die (d4 through d100,or several dice such as 2d6)
        <li>Card oracles use a full playing-card or tarot deck.</li>
    </ul>
    <li>Rolling dice tables and drawing from a session-shuffled deck</li>
    <li>Flows — chain oracles, ask questions, and branch</li>
    <li>Export and import oracles and flows as a JSON file</li>
    <li>Color themes (Check the Top Right for a dropdown)</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="display-6">Future Features:</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Character Sheet Storage</li>
    <li>Multi-user accounts</li>
</ul>
